  E -->|SENT_FROM| I[IPAddress]\line
  U -->|HOSTED_BY| I\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel3 \b \fs24 4.2.4 T\u7915 ? \u273 ?i\u7875 ?n d\u7919 ? li\u7879 ?u (Data Dictionary)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \u272 ?\u7875 ? b\u225 ?o c\u225 ?o th\u7889 ?ng nh\u7845 ?t v\u7899 ?i tri\u7875 ?n khai, nh\u243 ?m m\u244 ? t\u7843 ? c\u225 ?c thu\u7897 ?c t\u237 ?nh ch\u237 ?nh nh\u432 ? sau.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b A) Node {\f1 Email}}\par}
