{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Controller ch\u237 ?nh: {\f1 GraphController} v\u7899 ?i nh\u243 ?m endpoint {\f1 /api/graph/*}.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 5.1.5 C\u7845 ?u tr\u250 ?c m\u227 ? ngu\u7891 ?n (t\u243 ?m t\u7855 ?t)\par}
