{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Ingest \u273 ?\u7911 ? triad \u8594 ? full graph c\u243 ? \u273 ?\u7911 ? 3 node + 3 link.\par}
