{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1)\tx360\tab Tr\u432 ?\u7899 ?c analyze: graph c\u243 ? node/edge nh\u432 ?ng ch\u432 ?a c\u243 ? {\f1 riskScore/verdict}.\par}
