{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab K\u7923 ? v\u7885 ?ng: c\u225 ?c node \u273 ?\u7911 ? triad \u273 ?\u432 ?\u7907 ?c g\u225 ?n {\f1 riskScore} v\u224 ? {\f1 verdict} (SAFE/SUSPICIOUS/FRAUD); node thi\u7871 ?u triad gi\u7919 ? {\f1 UNKNOWN}.\sa180\par}
